/// Observed readiness facts at tenant, inventory scope and native device identity grain. Disconnected backlog fact. Left lookup to same-batch DeviceInventoryEvidence by TenantKey and normalized Device Source ID; unmatched or ambiguous joins remain Indeterminate. Condition states reproduce Compare-ReadinessFindings filters; missing required inputs take precedence over Not applicable.
table 'Device Readiness Gap Evidence'
	lineageTag: 81a3406e-771d-43ed-83c0-59262cbca544

	/// All source identities, including AD-only and unclassified joins.
	measure 'Readiness Observed Devices' = IF(CALCULATE(COUNTROWS('Readiness Source Status'), REMOVEFILTERS('Readiness Source Status'), 'Readiness Source Status'[Table Name] = "Device Readiness Gap Evidence", 'Readiness Source Status'[Source Available] = TRUE()) = 1,COALESCE(COUNTROWS('Device Readiness Gap Evidence'),0),BLANK())
